# Environment Configuration key names for this Environment (ADR-0035 / ADR-0053).
# Copy to `.env` (gitignored) and fill in values, or export the same keys in your shell.
# Optional `.env.override` overlays `.env` on key collision (shell still wins over both).
# Workload Setup never reads this file — it is documentation for operators only.
#
# Binding remaps these bag keys onto Requires environment names (not Manifest lists).
# Prefer not to use PLATFORM_* or Credential names (e.g. DIGITALOCEAN_TOKEN) here.
# Do not remap ROOT_DB_* into a Workload — those are Database admin credentials
# (ADR-0049), staged for the Database Component, not the Workload bag.
#
# Strict dotenv subset in `.env` / `.env.override`: KEY=value, # comments / blanks,
# optional double quotes. No export, interpolation, or multiline.
# Precedence: shell > .env.override > .env.
#
# Database admin credentials (mandatory for Database Setup; not Workload Configuration):
ROOT_DB_USER=
ROOT_DB_PASSWORD=
